-the other half-day keeps that period open for browsing.
+The desktop day view shows the whole Beijing day in one continuous schedule
+table: all-day entries and deadlines stay pinned while timed blocks for the
+morning and afternoon share the same list. It centers the current Beijing time
+and follows it as time passes. Scrolling manually pauses following; click
+**现在** to resume.
 
